    // After deallocating obj3, obj2, obj1 (in that order), the free list is:
    // head -> obj1 -> obj2 -> obj3
    // When we allocate again, we get: obj1, obj2, obj3 (in that order)
    // So obj4 should be at the same address as obj1
    // obj5 should be at the same address as obj2
    // obj6 should be at the same address as obj3

